# Dev Workflow

## Run

```bash
cd ~/repo/app_tlt_pronunciation
npm run dev        # Vite HMR — http://127.0.0.1:3030 (may use 3031 if busy)
npm run preview    # Python static server, no HMR
npm run build      # writes dist/
```

## HMR behavior

- JS/CSS/`.vue` → hot reload (no full refresh)
- `glyph-layout.json` → **full page reload** (static Vite import — by design)
- After `npm run build`, serve `dist/` with `npm run preview:vite`

## Layout tuning (no agent needed)

1. Edit `js/data/glyph-layout.json`
2. Save → page auto-reloads
3. Iterate. All numbers are SVG slice units.

## Audio tuning

- Drop `assets/audio/consonants/<wylie>.mp3` → picked up on next reload, no code change
- Or edit `js/data/consonant-audio-offsets.json` → Vite hot-reloads the page

## Public assets symlink

`public/assets` → `../assets` (symlink). After fresh clone, if missing:
```bash
ln -sfn ../assets public/assets
```

## Deploy

Manual upload by Jose. No GitHub Pages. Upload repo root preserving `index.html`, `css/`, `js/`, `assets/`.
